# Experiment 1 — change a model.
#
# The curator is the expensive call and the judgment-heavy one. Does it have to
# be Opus? This is the whole experiment: one line.
#
#   bin/ab.sh run curator-model      (offline, on frozen fixtures)
#   BLOG_PROFILE=curator-sonnet bin/suggest.sh   (once, by hand, to see it)
CURATE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
